{"data": [{"author_id": "1992461", "created_at": "2026-11-03T03:23:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117457541173293157"], "id": "2117457541173293157", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 78, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "日本国内出生人口推移数据公布：2025 年出生人口降至 67 万人，而 2015 年这个数字还是 100 万整。\n\n十年之内直接腰斩掉三分之一的新增人口，这个断崖速度彻底击穿了日本国立人口研究所此前制定的最悲观情景预测线。", "url": "https://x.com/fishjar/status/2117457541173293157"}, {"author_id": "2097629682543763456", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:41:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117432019030351894"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 36, "id": "1720665183188922368", "start": 31, "username": "grok"}]}, "id": "2117432019030351894", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 102, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今日地球总出生人口多少？\n死亡人口多少？\n\n各个国家分别列举\n@grok", "url": "https://x.com/haozihan001/status/2117432019030351894"}, {"author_id": "2061519004125298688", "created_at": "2026-11-03T08:41:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117537642858582478"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/MsCuD95FJ5", "end": 53, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/qianwan_X/status/2117537642858582478/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117537635090808832", "start": 30, "url": "https://t.co/MsCuD95FJ5"}]}, "id": "2117537642858582478", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 63, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我横看竖看，上看下看，没想到中国出生人口率还能这么高🥲🥲🥲 https://t.co/MsCuD95FJ5", "url": "https://x.com/qianwan_X/status/2117537642858582478"}, {"author_id": "2009622249247281152", "created_at": "2026-11-03T05:57:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117496425751969969"], "id": "2117496425751969969", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 84, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一个冷知识\n\n90后的出生人口是2.08亿\n\n而上一次人口普查显示90后还剩1.84亿", "url": "https://x.com/lanchang_blue/status/2117496425751969969"}, {"author_id": "2080217496267923456", "created_at": "2026-11-03T07:06:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117513760311276021"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 42, "start": 37, "tag": "育齡世代"}, {"end": 48, "start": 43, "tag": "出生人口"}, {"end": 59, "start": 49, "tag": "TFC台北生殖中心"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/CbR6b1VVpD", "end": 83, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/knews_taiwan/status/2117513760311276021/video/1", "media_key": "13_2117512219940548608", "start": 60, "url": "https://t.co/CbR6b1VVpD"}]}, "id": "2117513760311276021", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 67, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "沒有150萬不敢生！最新調查曝育齡世代焦慮　專家籲「台積電模式」助育兒\n\n#育齡世代 #出生人口 #TFC台北生殖中心 https://t.co/CbR6b1VVpD", "url": "https://x.com/knews_taiwan/status/2117513760311276021"}, {"author_id": "1944132010681020416", "created_at": "2026-11-04T07:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117874490416022010"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 77, "id": "1720665183188922368", "start": 72, "username": "grok"}]}, "id": "2117874490416022010", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 380, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一个扎心的事实\n华人最爱去的加州\n外国出生人口一年少了21.4万\n全美就它一个在减\n是房价？税？还是生活成本？\n给我排出前三名原因\n谢谢☺️\n\n@grok", "url": "https://x.com/FlavinMine1313/status/2117874490416022010"}, {"author_id": "1839340927166578688", "created_at": "2026-11-03T04:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117466800677929325"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Wp5DnMhvCy", "end": 79, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ke_ba57088/status/2117466800677929325/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117318277403963392", "start": 56, "url": "https://t.co/Wp5DnMhvCy"}]}, "id": "2117466800677929325", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 589, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国近25年的出生人口曲线图✅✅✅\n\n统计局做表格的这位先生\n绝对是旷世奇才\n\n我TM足足看了5分钟才缓过劲来 https://t.co/Wp5DnMhvCy", "url": "https://x.com/ke_ba57088/status/2117466800677929325"}, {"author_id": "1788497048582455296", "created_at": "2026-11-04T03:01:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117814584153354693"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/ppigadvance/st…", "end": 96, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/ppigadvance/status/2116405265285402926", "start": 73, "url": "https://t.co/ij4hCRJ9kb"}]}, "id": "2117814584153354693", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116405265285402926", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "粉蛆自欺欺人的程度够的上穆斯林了，还阵痛，再过多少年还是会这样说的，一看就是没干过流水线的，现在出生人口崩了，你给几亿人养老行不行，社会达尔文蛆 https://t.co/ij4hCRJ9kb", "url": "https://x.com/xijinping_pong/status/2117814584153354693"}, {"author_id": "1854578338414665745", "created_at": "2026-11-03T13:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117602694567444576"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/7VvRTiCcgL", "end": 79, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/JenniferLi67342/status/2117602694567444576/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117427827716857856", "start": 56, "url": "https://t.co/7VvRTiCcgL"}]}, "id": "2117602694567444576", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4279, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "10年时间，由于习近平的独裁统治，造成中国的生存环境极端恶化，\n并导致新出生人口逐年下降，到现在只剩下零头了！ https://t.co/7VvRTiCcgL", "url": "https://x.com/JenniferLi67342/status/2117602694567444576"}, {"author_id": "1474543955266183170", "created_at": "2026-11-04T18:52:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118053826712195212"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/threerights1/s…", "end": 157, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/threerights1/status/2116146961485377996", "start": 134, "url": "https://t.co/uTfhyCjHES"}]}, "id": "2118053826712195212", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116146961485377996", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "爱国粉红们，你们老是为东大的GDP骄傲\n\n算算你手里的钱多了吗？工资涨了吗？房价缩水了吗？财富多了吗？社保交得起吗？养老有保障吗？\n\n2025年中国65岁以上的人口已经超过14岁以下的儿童，未富先老。\n\n2025年出生人口断崖式下降，已经低于抗战时期的1942年了！ https://t.co/uTfhyCjHES", "url": "https://x.com/Jade777666/status/2118053826712195212"}, {"author_id": "340142471", "created_at": "2026-11-03T19:01:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117693680547205369"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/JXPtyrAQZ6", "end": 128, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Betaer/status/2117693680547205369/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117693638365057024", "start": 105, "url": "https://t.co/JXPtyrAQZ6"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/JXPtyrAQZ6", "end": 128, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Betaer/status/2117693680547205369/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117693638318936064", "start": 105, "url": "https://t.co/JXPtyrAQZ6"}, {"display_url": "x.com/Betaer/status/…", "end": 152, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Betaer/status/2117118005092225167", "start": 129, "url": "https://t.co/AayowqEPGH"}]}, "id": "2117693680547205369", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 193, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117118005092225167", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "这两张图，建议截图留着当反面教材📊\n\n第一张把纵轴倒过来，出生人口明明一路往下掉，画出来却像在猛涨\n\n第二张把月份倒着排，10月放最左边，涨和跌直接对调\n\n数据一个没改，光动坐标轴就能把跌画成涨，看图先看轴👀 https://t.co/JXPtyrAQZ6 https://t.co/AayowqEPGH", "url": "https://x.com/Betaer/status/2117693680547205369"}, {"author_id": "1059670824389533696", "created_at": "2026-11-03T14:46:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117629415949553856"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/superheroyy520…", "end": 164, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/superheroyy520/status/2117112437682078189", "start": 141, "url": "https://t.co/JkCeRRNbpg"}]}, "id": "2117629415949553856", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117112437682078189", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "不说别的，我感谢计划生育🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻\n中国要是依然保持每年2000-5000万的出生人口，现在人口规模可以突破16-18亿。单休月薪三千工作都要抢，跟印度一样外卖10分钟送达，你不干外卖有的是人干。\n每年毕业季3000万人失业，不敢想，真的不敢想。\n计划生育，罪在当代，功在后代。 https://t.co/JkCeRRNbpg", "url": "https://x.com/TinaWu83126140/status/2117629415949553856"}, {"author_id": "1519037451171471360", "created_at": "2026-11-04T00:51:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117781838265524407"], "id": "2117781838265524407", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 606, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "加州，华人最喜欢移民的州，也是美国移民最多的州，去年少了 21.4 万移民。而且，全美只有它一个州在减少。\n\n人口普查局十月底刚发布的年度调查（ACS）显示：加州的外国出生人口从 2024 年的 1,090 万，降到 2025 年的 1,069 万，一年净减约 21.4 万。同期全美外国出生人口总数基本没动，还微增了 17", "url": "https://x.com/MelaniemeiWang/status/2117781838265524407"}, {"author_id": "1981197160311115777", "created_at": "2026-11-04T16:17:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118014659328692473"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/CUXQmGfRSK", "end": 171, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Web3shiguangzhe/status/2118014659328692473/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117829738811273216", "start": 148, "url": "https://t.co/CUXQmGfRSK"}]}, "id": "2118014659328692473", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "说不定再过10来年，征兵工作可能越来越难。\n\n每年征召义务兵大约80万，有少量女性忽略不计，视全部\n男生计算，70%近视率排除，那么男生需要大概270万，\n合计当年适龄人口约530万。\n\n去年出生人口不到800万，后面持续降低后，合格男生将\n不足，只能降低标准。以后男娃大概4个就有1个要入伍。 https://t.co/CUXQmGfRSK", "url": "https://x.com/Web3shiguangzhe/status/2118014659328692473"}, {"author_id": "1981197160311115777", "created_at": "2026-11-04T10:50:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117932367298105423"], "id": "2117932367298105423", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 223, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "川子参众两院惨败超出我的预料。\n\n民众用实际行动对他近两年的表现给出评判。\n\n关税，移民，通胀，比特币，操纵股市，\n\n自封为King，伊朗战争，还有通鹅等等。\n\n川子后面举步维艰，马斯克，维特科夫等\n\n都会有麻烦。\n\n小乌终于度过最艰难时期，大鹅错过最好\n\n的时机。", "url": "https://x.com/Web3shiguangzhe/status/2117932367298105423"}, {"author_id": "2109577075548098560", "created_at": "2026-11-03T12:23:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117593437134610701"], "id": "2117593437134610701", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一定会走上贬值通胀的道路\n\n目前通缩情形不利于年轻人的发展，年轻人工资收入不如体制内退休人员，怎么会结婚生育，出生人口断崖式下跌，社会方方面面都会出问题，最基本的人口再生产都玩不转了，化什么债…\n\n2012日本无限量QE，日元一路贬值，这条路人民币一定会重新走一遍，别无他法", "url": "https://x.com/w2sbg4Cf/status/2117593437134610701"}, {"author_id": "2034514446656360448", "created_at": "2026-11-04T05:54:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117857959749542090", "2117869172629897648"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/yurinb6666666/…", "end": 158, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/yurinb6666666/status/2117842836750291424", "start": 135, "url": "https://t.co/lsHskDk3jp"}]}, "id": "2117857959749542090", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117842836750291424", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "要知道，新疆一个省去年的新增新生儿人口23.6W，是你们日本全国新生出生人口的三分之一，\n所以我说，“支持冲绳人独立，解放冲绳！！！”\n\n我们还不是像你们政府那样为了敌对中国，专门篡改历史，张口编那些关于新疆，西藏的谎言这种有理有据低级操作，我们还是按照现实情况来的。 https://t.co/lsHskDk3jp", "url": "https://x.com/moritakiko69967/status/2117857959749542090"}, {"author_id": "1704460250584346624", "created_at": "2026-11-03T03:36:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117460843671740827"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/JWGspoE7Nr", "end": 164, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/lgvpid/status/2117460843671740827/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117460791653961728", "start": 141, "url": "https://t.co/JWGspoE7Nr"}]}, "id": "2117460843671740827", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 169, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "现在年轻人不愿意生孩子，真的不能全怪年轻人。\n\n2025年全国出生人口792万，比上一年少了162万。\n\n说实话，换谁都得算算账。\n\n房贷要还，工作不稳定，结婚要花钱，生孩子要花钱，奶粉、教育、托育，哪一样不要钱？\n\n更现实的是，很多年轻夫妻连自己都快养不起了，还敢轻易要孩子吗？ https://t.co/JWGspoE7Nr", "url": "https://x.com/lgvpid/status/2117460843671740827"}, {"author_id": "2295669319", "created_at": "2026-11-03T18:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117678193721135180"], "id": "2117678193721135180", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 81, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "看着统计局公布的出生人口数据持续回落的老郑，在与晚辈促膝长谈后彻底放下了催生的执念。\n高昂教育成本与职场断层让陈浩和林思佳屡屡退缩，旁人怪青年不肯吃苦，老人却读懂了这份克制；\n当养育代价远超普通工薪的负荷极限，选择推迟或不生不是任性摆烂，而是对生命最深沉的敬畏；", "url": "https://x.com/MybroBot/status/2117678193721135180"}, {"author_id": "2034514446656360448", "created_at": "2026-11-04T06:38:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117857959749542090", "2117869172629897648"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/yurinb6666666/…", "end": 145, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/yurinb6666666/status/2117842836750291424", "start": 122, "url": "https://t.co/lsHskDk3jp"}]}, "id": "2117869172629897648", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 117, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117842836750291424", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "要知道，新疆一个省去年的新增新生儿人口23.6W，是你们日本全国新生出生人口的三分之一，\n冲绳全是美军，强奸了日本女性都不能执法，强奸犯哪里都会被追责，日本冲绳做不到，这才是人道主义灾难，所以，来，跟着我一起“支持冲绳人独立，解放冲绳！！！” https://t.co/lsHskDk3jp", "url": "https://x.com/moritakiko69967/status/2117869172629897648"}, {"author_id": "1867240028835115008", "created_at": "2026-11-04T04:00:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117829341895971160"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ExrI2cGZ82", "en